#: src/plugins/krunner-integration/kwin-runner-windows.desktop:120
msgctxt "X-Plasma-Runner-Syntax-Descriptions"
msgid ""
"Finds windows whose name or window application match :q:. It is possible to "
"interact with the windows by using one of the following keywords: activate\\"
"\\, close\\\\, min(imize)\\\\, max(imize)\\\\, fullscreen\\\\, "
"shade\\\\, keep above and keep below.,Finds windows which are on desktop "
"named :q:,Switch to desktop named :q:,Lists all windows and allows to activate "
"them.,Lists all other desktops and allows to switch to them."
msgstr "Pronalazi prozore čiji se naziv ili aplikacija podudaraju s pojmom :q:. Prozorima možete upravljati pomoću sljedećih ključnih riječi: activate\\, close\\\\, min(imize)\\\\, max(imize)\\\\, fullscreen\\\\, shade\\\\, keep above and keep below.,Pronalazi prozore na radnoj površini naziva :q:,Prebacuje se na radnu površinu naziva :q:,Prikazuje sve prozore i omogućuje njihovu aktivaciju.,Prikazuje ostale radne površine i omogućuje prebacivanje na njih."